{
  "findings": [
    {
      "id": "autoloader-generic",
      "level": "warn",
      "places": [],
      "lines": [
        "The app ships no composer/autoload.php, so the server registers its generic loader for lib/ and looks every class up in the file system.",
        "  A composer/composer.json with config.vendor-dir \".\", config.optimize-autoloader true, a config.autoloader-suffix and autoload.psr-4 {\"OCA\\\\OrchestraScoresManager\\\\\": \"../lib/\"} makes composer dump-autoload write composer/autoload.php with a class map; the code of the app does not change."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "ocp-deprecated",
      "level": "info",
      "places": [
        "lib/Migration/Version000002001Date20251129000001.php:60 OCP\\IDBConnection::lastInsertId(): deprecated since Nextcloud 21; use \\OCP\\DB\\QueryBuilder\\IQueryBuilder::getLastInsertId"
      ],
      "lines": [
        "1 use in 1 file of the public API that is deprecated in Nextcloud 33 to 34. The text of the tag names the replacement where it has one.",
        "  lib/Migration/Version000002001Date20251129000001.php:60 OCP\\IDBConnection::lastInsertId(): deprecated since Nextcloud 21; use \\OCP\\DB\\QueryBuilder\\IQueryBuilder::getLastInsertId"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "transaction-manual",
      "level": "info",
      "places": [
        "lib/Db/ScoreBookScoreLinkMapper.php:133",
        "lib/Db/ScoreBookTagLinkMapper.php:92",
        "lib/Db/ScoreFolderCollectionLinkMapper.php:345",
        "lib/Db/ScoreTagLinkMapper.php:96",
        "lib/Db/SetlistEntryMapper.php:66"
      ],
      "lines": [
        "5 transactions are opened and closed by hand. The trait TTransactional has atomic() since Nextcloud 24 and atomicRetry() since Nextcloud 27, which repeats a transaction that ran into a deadlock, as the manual recommends.",
        "  lib/Db/ScoreBookScoreLinkMapper.php:133",
        "  lib/Db/ScoreBookTagLinkMapper.php:92",
        "  lib/Db/ScoreFolderCollectionLinkMapper.php:345",
        "  lib/Db/ScoreTagLinkMapper.php:96",
        "  lib/Db/SetlistEntryMapper.php:66"
      ],
      "folds": [
        {
          "at": 4,
          "count": 2
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "time-direct",
      "level": "info",
      "places": [
        "lib/Db/SetlistMapper.php:48 new DateTimeImmutable()",
        "lib/Db/SetlistMapper.php:61 new DateTimeImmutable()",
        "lib/Utility/DateTimeHelper.php:51 new DateTimeImmutable()"
      ],
      "lines": [
        "lib/ reads the clock directly in 3 places. OCP\\AppFramework\\Utility\\ITimeFactory, a PSR-20 ClockInterface, gives the same time and can be replaced in a test.",
        "  lib/Db/SetlistMapper.php:48 new DateTimeImmutable()",
        "  lib/Db/SetlistMapper.php:61 new DateTimeImmutable()",
        "  lib/Utility/DateTimeHelper.php:51 new DateTimeImmutable()"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "config-without-lexicon",
      "level": "info",
      "places": [
        "lib/Service/ConfigService.php:26 getAppValueArray()",
        "lib/Service/ConfigService.php:37 setAppValueArray()"
      ],
      "lines": [
        "The app reads and writes its app config in 2 places and registers no config lexicon, which IRegistrationContext::registerConfigLexicon() takes since Nextcloud 31. A lexicon states the type, the default and the sensitivity of each key in one place.",
        "  lib/Service/ConfigService.php:26 getAppValueArray()",
        "  lib/Service/ConfigService.php:37 setAppValueArray()"
      ]
    }
  ],
